issues, it is about where you are on the political&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:31.620
spectrum. You know, a woman's right to choose.&nbsp;
I don't think it's about accountability now.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:37.140
What I will say is, like, for example, for many&nbsp;
right wingers who oppose abortion being legal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:41.520
they like to take this approach of,&nbsp;
well, it's about accountability in that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:46.380
if you engage in the type of sexual&nbsp;
activity that leads to a pregnancy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:51.780
