00:06:55.980 --> 00:07:00.300
I think that's the approach we should have.
Speaker 5: Okay. Well, that's good to know.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:04.680
I do think accountability is definitely&nbsp;
a big part of it. All right. But, yes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:09.420
I think so. Thank you for your feedback.
Speaker 1: All right, Smitty from L.A.,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:15.360
great to hear from you. Always appreciate it.&nbsp;
Let's go to I hope I pronounce this correctly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:21.420
Is this is it fit Phineas or pennies&nbsp;
from Kansas? How do you pronounce that?&nbsp;

